  This method allows to handle messages that are sent by the WebSocket, either from the page or from the server.

  When called on the original WebSocket route, this method handles messages sent from the page. You can handle this messages by responding to them with `PlaywrightEx.WebSocketRoute.send/2`, forwarding them to the server-side connection returned by `PlaywrightEx.WebSocketRoute.connect_to_server/1` or do something else.

